Did you eat a tripe ration and shoot up two levels? Or did you eat
half a tripe ration, gained a level, then (later) ate the rest of the
tripe ration and gained another? Each of these would certainly be a
bug.

Or did you twice have an occurence of "this tripe ration tastes
terrible! Welcome to Experience level n(n').", with two different
tripe rations and a bit of monster-bashing between meals? This
wouldn't be a bug, because eating a tripe ration while not being a
carnivore (i think that's the condition; it means you mustn't be
polymorphed into something which finds tripe rations delicious) gives
you a tiny amount of experience, and like any sort of experience, this
can push you above a level threshold.

